{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1196351-thoughts-on-future-lunar-combat-options","id":1196351,"title":"Thoughts on Future Lunar Combat options","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-16T20:44:06-07:00","id":1196351,"title":"Thoughts on Future Lunar Combat options","content":"So, in this thread I wanted to get people\u2019s opinions on possible Lunar Combat styles. What I mean by that is distinct charm trees that a Lunar can invest in that allow for a unique play experience. For Solar\u2019s this is easy enough to track because each one has its own ability associated with it. While some trees have a few charms here and there that can be used for combat for Solars I would say there a seven main areas. <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Melee</li> <li>Brawl</li> <li>Archery</li> <li>Thrown</li> <li>Dodge</li> <li>Resistance</li> <li>Martial arts</li> </ol><br /> Dodge and Resistance are not pure combat abilities but a solar with supernal dodge and a few melee charms plays pretty differently from a solar with supernal melee and some dodge charms so I do think it is a meaningful distinction.<br /> Moving on to lunars then the question becomes how will their options shakeout? Based on what Vance and Minton have said so far, my thoughts are as follows. <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Animal based shapeshifting. This one seems to be roughly equivalent to the brawl tree given the fact that most animal combat pools will be based on dexterity plus brawl. The benefits seem to be based around making use of the animal\u2019s natural merits, special attacks and in most cases the free dice given because of their higher than average pools. There is also an expectation that many of the lunars natural charms will have a unique added effect while in animal form per the QC preview.</li> <li>Deadly beast man transformation. Per the QC previews this form give a flat bonus to damage and soak and will weaken your connection to your evocations if you got them. At this point I do not know if there is any prohibition between DBT and using martial arts. If anyone has any dev statements or thoughts on the matter they would be greatly appreciated.</li> <li>Hybrid body transformation. While this is a prerequisite to DBT it looks like it will not have the same prohibitions attached to it. This seems to be the option to use if you want to fight as a primarily \u201chuman\u201d fighter. It is my understanding that you will have full access to both evocations and martials arts.</li> <li>Since resistance has a strong combat focus for Solar\u2019s I would expect that stamina would have the same for Lunars. My thought though is I am not sure if dodge will get a tree in the same way it did for Solar\u2019s. For people who played previous editions what where the options for an elusive dodge-based lunar?</li> </ol><br /> So, what are your guys thoughts regarding likely Lunar combat options. What type of combat options did they have in previous editions?<br /> Do you expect any combat based trees in non-physical attributes like charisma or wits?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/223-calboon","name":"Calboon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar223_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T20:50:35-07:00","id":1196353,"title":"","content":"I did a thread like this, once.<br /> <br /> You forgot &quot;I'm a giant&quot; and<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm an army of Me.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T01:52:27-07:00","id":1196417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Calboon</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">For people who played previous editions what where the options for an elusive dodge-based lunar?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was in Dexterity, and... basically it was exactly the same as the Solar one, just everything cost slightly more. Pretty dull, IMO, but people took it for the perfect.<br /> Whereas Stamina was much more interesting, with loads of soak-boosting and regen, which Solar Resistance didn't do as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T08:10:43-07:00","id":1196492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1196351-thoughts-on-future-lunar-combat-options?p=1196353#post1196353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I did a thread like this, once.<br /> <br /> You forgot &quot;I'm a giant&quot; and<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm an army of Me.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you build on what these would entail mechanically? What benefits do you expect a giant person to have. The legendary size merit seems like a easy pick but what else could they get.<br /> <br /> Also how would you mechanically represent creating clones of yourself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/223-calboon","name":"Calboon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar223_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T09:56:04-07:00","id":1196517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Calboon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1196351-thoughts-on-future-lunar-combat-options?p=1196492#post1196492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you build on what these would entail mechanically? What benefits do you expect a giant person to have. The legendary size merit seems like a easy pick but what else could they get.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno. Might just be supplemental to other combat styles. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also how would you mechanically represent creating clones of yourself? </div> </div> </div>Becoming a battle-group in a similar fashion to Solar Athletics Faster-Than-Self Technique, but with very different prerequisites and drawbacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}